~ start
Rooster: Are you the new merchant?
Rooster: I heard that you sell dumplings to the Jade Emperor.
Rooster: A tradition over 500 years old! How persistent. Is there anything you'd like to ask me?

~ main_menu
- Is the Jade Emperor a fan of my family's dumplings?
	Rooster: Why yes. Why else would he continually purchase from your family all these years?
- What if I don't want to go down this path for my entire life?
	Rooster: I'd recommend that you talk to some of the other animals first. But I hope you have the courage to pursue your dreams. 
- Offer dumplings
	Rooster: Well, I'm sure this can be good practice for you to see if you actually like it or not.
	set Global.offered_dumplings = true
	do Global.start_dumplings_minigame()
	=> END
- Walk away
	[if Global.offered_dumplings == false] 
	Rooster: I thought you had something more to say?
=> END